*Key Formulae:*
- Tangent circles map to parallel lines under inversion centered at the point of contact: $w = 1 / (z - z_0)$
- Exponential map: $z mapsto e^z$ maps horizontal strip ${0 < "Im"(z) < pi}$ onto UHP
